      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (North Side)                                                   Bourne End                                                   Former Bourne End Mill                                                   at Watermill Motel TL 0206 5/107 II 2. Early C19 on site of mill dating back to 1289.  Red brick, mansard slated roof with coped gable ends.  2 storeys with 3 storey gabled and weatherboarded central block.  7 casement windows with glazing bars under cambered arches.  Extensive modern additions towards road. Listing NGR: TL0216806349"
